A||||10||pHoOl||Automatic Trans question||||1||
Z||000000||pHoOl||09-17-2000||05:54 PM||||Anybody know how to figure out if I have the performance or the economy shifting trans?  I've heard in this forum that there are two, and i've asked before, but never gotten a response as to how i can find it out.  I looked on the sticker on the front fender under the hood, but didn't find what i was looking for.<P>Anybody know what the code is for the performance, and what the code for the economy is?  Last time, i was told a four character code for one and a three character code for the other.  All of the codes on my sticker are three character.<P>any help?<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||09-17-2000||08:05 PM||||There is no such thing. The only diferant versions of TH125 are the final gears. Has nothing to do with shifting.<P>If the original transmission is still in the car then the final gear is listed in the RPO codes. If the transmission has been changed then the only way to be sure is find the tag on the tranny and run those numbers by a dealer.||||reg||1
Z||000002||pHoOl||09-17-2000||08:46 PM||||Do you know what the codes are to tell the difference?  You're right, it is in the gear ratio, not shifting.  It's the original trans.  Thanks!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||pHoOl||09-17-2000||08:46 PM||||Do you know what the codes are to tell the difference?  You're right, it is in the gear ratio, not shifting.  It's the original trans.  Thanks!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||86SE||09-17-2000||09:01 PM||||F17 = 2.84 final drive<BR>GT7 = 3.33 Final Drive<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||14
Z||000005||baldlobo||09-17-2000||10:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 86SE:<BR><B>F17 = 2.84 final drive<BR>GT7 = 3.33 Final Drive<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>F75	RATIO, TRANSAXLE FINAL DRIVE 3.18||||reg||1
