Z||000007||pHoOl||09-18-2000||05:56 PM||||Okay, i checked on the sticker on the front left wheel well, under the hood.  I didn't see any of these three codes.  If somebody has a digital camara, could they take a picture of it, and maybe circle where it should be on the picture?  I feel dumb that i can't find it.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000008||theogre||09-18-2000||07:47 PM||||Assuming I typed these in right......<BR>The following RPO codes apply to TH125c and 440 T4 transmission final drive gears.<P>FP3, FW2, FW9, F47, F90 = 3.06 <BR>F16, F17, F62, F75 = 2.84<BR>F77, F79, GX3 = 3.33<P>||||reg||1
