Z||000010||pHoOl||09-19-2000||12:25 PM||||OKay, checked the car and found the GX3.  The higher the number the faster the car will be?  Cause if this is the case, I"m still puzzled why i can't beat 11 seconds 0-60.  Any ideas?  I've heard of possibly decarbonizing stuff that goes through the engine and cleans it.  Is this stuff that i could do myself in the parking lot?  or would i have to take it to a shop?  <P>Maybe a performance air cleaner?  who knows, i'm just getting worried that there's something seriously wrong that i havne't found yet.<P>thanks all!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
